    puts stderr {representations, such as compact binary encodings, XML, or JSON. cereal}
    puts stderr {was designed to be fast, light-weight, and easy to extend - it has no}
    puts stderr {external dependencies and can be easily bundled with other code or used}
    puts stderr {standalone.}
